# P41 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): three date picker styles, each moved on its own.
# GTK has no stepper field: .automatic and .compact are a button whose popover holds a calendar (.automatic was the grid until 2026-10-16), so "one month forward" is the popover's month arrows -- next, next, previous, as the AppKit file steps up, up, down. The arrows now report the date (they moved the calendar without telling the binding until 2026-10-16).
# Measured 2026-10-16 from p41-macos-gtk4-final-20261016-065823.png and -065846.png (popover open), 2x halved, origin=frame. The .compact popover is the .automatic one moved by the buttons' offset (-7, +168). Every y moved +37 the same day (p41-macos-gtk4-final-20261016-100633.png): the .hourMinuteAndSecond label no longer wraps a character per line, so the shorter content sits centred in the 648 pt window.
# After this file: .automatic 2025-09-24, .compact 2025-09-24, .graphical 2025-08-17.
# GTK 沒有步進欄位：.automatic 與 .compact 是開啟月曆的按鈕，以月份箭頭前進一個月；之後 .automatic 與 .compact 為 2025-09-24、.graphical 為 2025-08-17。
